        69.16120147705078,
        527.2117919921875,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "The WHO Global TB Programme initiated an update of the current guidelines and commissioned",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.6401977539062,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "a systematic review on the use of high complexity reverse hybridization-based NAATs for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        456.46490478515625,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "detection of pyrazinamide resistance in people with signs and symptoms of TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        122.66522979736328,
        527.287841796875,
        135.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "Two PICO questions were designed to form the basis for the evidence search, retrieval",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        136.66522216796875,
        133.08201599121094,
        149.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "and analysis:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        156.4171142578125,
        527.1314697265625,
        169.56211853027344
      ],
      "text": "1.\t  Should high complexity reverse hybridization-based NAATs on sputum be used to diagnose",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        171.9171142578125,
        526.8828125,
        185.06211853027344
      ],
      "text": "pyrazinamide resistance in patients with microbiologically confirmed pulmonary TB,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        187.4171142578125,
        526.9862060546875,
        200.56211853027344
      ],
      "text": "irrespective of resistance to rifampicin, as compared with culture-based phenotypic DST or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        202.9171142578125,
        237.29930114746094,
        216.06211853027344
      ],
      "text": "composite reference standard?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        226.9210205078125,
        527.0806884765625,
        240.06602478027344
      ],
      "text": "2.\t  Should high complexity reverse hybridization-based NAATs on isolates be used to diagnose",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        242.4210205078125,
        526.8828125,
        255.56602478027344
      ],
      "text": "pyrazinamide resistance in patients with microbiologically confirmed pulmonary TB,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        257.9210205078125,
        518.2447509765625,
        271.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "irrespective of resistance to rifampicin, as compared with culture-based phenotypic DST?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.92498779296875,
        527.0030517578125,
        295.07000732421875
      ],
      "text": "The databases searched were PubMed, Web of Science and Embase, and they were searched",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.42498779296875,
        526.9647216796875,
        310.57000732421875
      ],
      "text": "without language or date restrictions. The search query was (PZA OR pyrazinamide OR pncA)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        312.92498779296875,
        526.9700927734375,
        326.07000732421875
      ],
      "text": "AND (tuberculosis) AND (“line-probe assay” OR LPA OR “hybridization-based technology”). In",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        328.4250183105469,
        452.7802734375,
        341.5700378417969
      ],
      "text": "addition, we approached Nipro (Osaka, Japan) to identify non-published data.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        352.4289245605469,
        526.9644165039062,
        365.5739440917969
      ],
      "text": "The microbiological reference standard was defined either as phenotypic culture-based DST",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.9289245605469,
        526.9371337890625,
        381.0739440917969
      ],
      "text": "performed using BD MGIT 960 PZA liquid assay or another acceptable phenotypic assay, or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.4289245605469,
        526.97509765625,
        396.5739440917969
      ],
      "text": "as genotypic DST performed using either targeted sequencing of the   gene or whole  pncA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.9289245605469,
        526.97314453125,
        412.0739440917969
      ],
      "text": "genome sequencing. In the case of genotypic DST, all samples with a   wild type were  pncA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.4289245605469,
        526.9361572265625,
        427.5739440917969
      ],
      "text": "defined as being susceptible, while any variant in   was considered resistant, which implicitly  pncA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        429.9289245605469,
        526.5733032226562,
        443.0739440917969
      ],
      "text": "would categorize “silent” mutations as resistant. In contrast, the composite reference standard",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979681968688965,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        445.4289245605469,
        526.9766845703125,
        458.5739440917969
      ],
      "text": "was defined by classifying all samples with   wild type,   silent mutations and neutral  pncA pncA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        460.9289245605469,
        524.4095458984375,
        474.0739440917969
      ],
      "text": "mutations as being susceptible, while any other variant in   was considered resistant  . pncA (13)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        483.43292236328125,
        527.128662109375,
        496.57794189453125
      ],
      "text": "Data synthesis was structured around the two preset PICO questions, as outlined below. Three",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990646362304688,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        497.43292236328125,
        328.7355041503906,
        510.57794189453125
      ],
      "text": "web annexes give additional information, as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        517.184814453125,
        78.81920623779297,
        530.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        517.184814453125,
        526.9024658203125,
        530.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "details of studies included in the current analysis ( Web Annex A.9: High complexity reverse",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.99384880065918,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        532.684814453125,
        223.15321350097656,
        545.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "); hybridization-based NAATs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        548.184814453125,
        78.81909942626953,
        561.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        548.184814453125,
        524.4078369140625,
        561.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "a summary of the results and details of the evidence quality assessment ( Web Annex A.9:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
